{"connection_id": "BC-7475667d53773bb4335b", "ref": "SBLGNT:Gal.4.19", "target": "sec4", "tradition": "incil", "kind": "motif", "basis": "formation through labor", "note": "The commentary’s womb image and staged raising meet Paul’s labor metaphor: he is again in the pains of childbirth until Christ is formed in his converts."}
