{"connection_id": "BC-026e42a48ab750739ff5", "ref": "SBLGNT:Heb.5.12", "target": "sec4", "tradition": "incil", "kind": "motif", "basis": "milk and solid food mark learning stages", "note": "The commentary defines upbringing as moving from state to state toward completion; Hebrews rebukes hearers who still need milk rather than solid food when they should be teachers."}
