{"connection_id": "BC-4f7c550713b7f03dff34", "ref": "SBLGNT:Heb.5.14", "target": "sec4", "tradition": "incil", "kind": "motif", "basis": "maturity follows training", "note": "The commentary’s education image moves toward completion; Hebrews says solid food belongs to the mature, whose faculties have been trained by practice to distinguish good from evil."}
